WEBVTT

00:00:01.040 --> 00:00:04.690
Next
Generation 
Painter

00:00:01.040 --> 00:00:04.690
<b>Mori Mitsuo</b>

00:00:01.040 --> 00:00:04.690
Nana's 
World 
of Ennui

00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:05.510
Mori-sensei...

00:00:06.920 --> 00:00:10.190
It seems your new exhibition
is a huge success.

00:00:10.190 --> 00:00:12.570
Between your popularity
and your ability,

00:00:12.570 --> 00:00:14.810
you're now the standard 
modern painters are held to.

00:00:14.810 --> 00:00:20.950
I only made it this far because I found 
a fantastic motif called Horie Nana.

00:00:20.950 --> 00:00:25.200
She has become a source of 
new-found inspiration for me.

00:00:50.380 --> 00:00:52.700
Care to share your impressions?

00:00:56.770 --> 00:00:58.140
Well, let's see.

00:00:58.390 --> 00:01:00.270
It's very well done,

00:01:00.270 --> 00:01:02.640
but the model's a bit...

00:01:02.640 --> 00:01:05.090
She is pretty,

00:01:05.090 --> 00:01:08.300
but when you take a good look,
she's making such a goofy face.

00:01:09.700 --> 00:01:11.320
Well, you've got me there!

00:01:13.470 --> 00:01:14.840
I'm sorry.

00:01:14.840 --> 00:01:16.260
But you know, Sensei...

00:01:16.700 --> 00:01:18.860
If you changed your model,

00:01:18.860 --> 00:01:21.780
I bet your paintings would be even better.

00:02:58.720 --> 00:03:01.540
What's the matter, Sensei?

00:03:02.010 --> 00:03:04.150
Oh, nothing. Nana-kun,

00:03:04.150 --> 00:03:07.040
you're looking prettier than usual lately.

00:03:07.040 --> 00:03:09.660
I bet the next exhibition will be great.

00:03:09.660 --> 00:03:11.990
You're such a flatterer.

00:03:17.850 --> 00:03:21.710
Sensei, you're really still 
using her as your model?

00:03:22.580 --> 00:03:23.490
You're...

00:03:23.490 --> 00:03:25.680
Who is she supposed to be?

00:03:25.680 --> 00:03:30.060
Don't you remember saying you 
wanted to end things with her

00:03:30.060 --> 00:03:33.540
and have me model for you instead?

00:03:33.750 --> 00:03:35.010
What?!

00:03:35.010 --> 00:03:36.960
Sensei, is that true?!

00:03:36.960 --> 00:03:38.560
O-Of course not!

00:03:38.560 --> 00:03:39.900
Come now, Sensei.

00:03:39.900 --> 00:03:41.490
Calling me a liar?

00:03:41.490 --> 00:03:43.670
I remember exactly what you said.

00:03:43.670 --> 00:03:45.690
"I'm tired of the Nana series.

00:03:45.690 --> 00:03:48.830
When you really look at her,
her face looks so silly

00:03:48.830 --> 00:03:51.350
that I can't get motivated to paint."

00:03:52.090 --> 00:03:56.830
I-I had no idea you felt that way about me!

00:03:56.830 --> 00:03:59.390
Nana-kun, hang on! You've it all wrong!

00:04:02.360 --> 00:04:04.220
I can't believe you.

00:04:04.220 --> 00:04:05.920
What were you thinking?

00:04:06.400 --> 00:04:09.350
Don't you realize she's been a 
valuable partner in my pursuits?

00:04:09.700 --> 00:04:14.060
Well, you could just use me as your
model instead, couldn't you?

00:04:14.560 --> 00:04:16.000
Wonderful idea, right?

00:04:19.890 --> 00:04:22.460
What's your name, anyway?

00:04:22.460 --> 00:04:23.440
Me?

00:04:23.930 --> 00:04:25.890
My name is Tomie.

00:04:26.400 --> 00:04:29.380
I'm impressed you were able
to find out where I live.

00:04:29.380 --> 00:04:32.650
With an amazing house like this,
it was no challenge at all!

00:04:32.650 --> 00:04:34.450
I wonder if I'm going to have to

00:04:34.450 --> 00:04:37.980
deal with more uninvited visitors 
like you in the future, then...

00:04:37.980 --> 00:04:39.470
Maybe.

00:04:39.470 --> 00:04:43.380
But you'll never run into a girl like me again.

00:04:44.020 --> 00:04:46.100
A girl like you?

00:04:46.100 --> 00:04:47.020
Of course.

00:04:47.490 --> 00:04:51.890
Because there's no other girl in 
the world quite as good as me.

00:04:51.890 --> 00:04:54.290
You sound pretty confident...

00:04:54.290 --> 00:04:56.040
The same goes for painting.

00:04:56.040 --> 00:04:58.490
You're a good painter,

00:04:58.490 --> 00:05:02.770
but can you really convey
my beauty on the canvas?

00:05:02.770 --> 00:05:06.330
I've had plenty of artists
try to do my portrait before,

00:05:06.330 --> 00:05:10.660
but none of them were
really able to pull it off.

00:05:11.220 --> 00:05:12.790
You see,

00:05:12.790 --> 00:05:16.250
I want my beauty to be recorded.

00:05:16.820 --> 00:05:19.350
I want it to be permanent.

00:05:26.020 --> 00:05:28.180
I think that does it.

00:05:28.180 --> 00:05:29.840
Is it finished?

00:05:29.840 --> 00:05:31.790
Let me see it.

00:05:31.790 --> 00:05:33.730
It turned out great.

00:05:36.720 --> 00:05:40.480
Oh, my, Sensei! You're so hilarious!

00:05:42.190 --> 00:05:43.910
Hilarious?!

00:05:43.910 --> 00:05:45.940
What's so funny about this painting?

00:05:45.940 --> 00:05:50.860
I mean, this thing doesn't even
convey 10% of my beauty!

00:05:50.860 --> 00:05:52.650
What a disappointment!

00:05:52.650 --> 00:05:54.660
I guess I overestimated you.

00:05:55.480 --> 00:05:58.210
Wh-What?! Hang on!

00:05:59.630 --> 00:06:00.920
Goodbye.

00:06:00.920 --> 00:06:03.220
I have no need for talentless artists.

00:06:09.800 --> 00:06:11.010
Damn it!

00:06:11.320 --> 00:06:14.470
What doesn't she like
about my masterpiece?

00:06:20.330 --> 00:06:21.940
<i>I want to paint her...</i>

00:06:21.940 --> 00:06:23.460
<i>Tomie... It's Tomie...</i>

00:06:23.460 --> 00:06:24.950
<i>I want to paint Tomie!</i>

00:06:24.950 --> 00:06:26.860
<i>I should be painting Tomie!</i>

00:06:31.680 --> 00:06:34.830
Tomie... Tomie...

00:06:36.210 --> 00:06:37.790
It's done!

00:06:38.440 --> 00:06:39.670
No!

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:43.640
It's not right at all!

00:06:47.090 --> 00:06:48.700
Tomie...

00:06:48.700 --> 00:06:50.260
Tomie!

00:06:56.050 --> 00:06:58.270
Hey, it's Mori.

00:06:58.830 --> 00:07:00.290
Hey, Masuda.

00:07:00.290 --> 00:07:01.690
It's been a while.

00:07:01.690 --> 00:07:05.270
I heard your next exhibition was postponed.

00:07:05.270 --> 00:07:07.300
You get sick or something?

00:07:07.300 --> 00:07:09.320
Something like that.

00:07:10.780 --> 00:07:11.980
Come to think of it,

00:07:11.980 --> 00:07:15.340
did you know Iwata is starting to get big?

00:07:15.340 --> 00:07:16.830
Iwata...

00:07:16.830 --> 00:07:19.060
You mean the sculptor, Iwata Tadaoka?

00:07:19.060 --> 00:07:20.370
Yeah.

00:07:20.370 --> 00:07:24.410
He's been announcing new works 
pretty regularly lately.

00:07:24.410 --> 00:07:28.210
The title of the series is... 
the model's name, I think?

00:07:28.210 --> 00:07:30.920
And this model is really something!

00:07:30.920 --> 00:07:32.920
Iwata, huh?

00:07:32.920 --> 00:07:36.770
I figured all he could manage
were dour figure statues.

00:07:36.770 --> 00:07:39.600
I guess this model helped him develop.

00:07:39.600 --> 00:07:43.190
I got a picture of them walking
around town the other day.

00:07:43.420 --> 00:07:44.720
This is it.

00:07:45.290 --> 00:07:47.700
It's a bad shot, though.

00:07:47.700 --> 00:07:50.300
The lady in question's face is all blurry.

00:07:50.300 --> 00:07:51.610
Pretty hot, though, right?

00:07:52.150 --> 00:07:54.710
That's Tomie!

00:07:54.710 --> 00:07:56.510
What, you know her?

00:07:56.510 --> 00:07:59.820
Oh, but that's it. The title 
of his series is "Tomie."

00:08:02.390 --> 00:08:04.310
Iwata! Iwata!

00:08:10.560 --> 00:08:12.310
H-Hey...

00:08:12.310 --> 00:08:15.230
Well, if it isn't Mori-kun.

00:08:15.230 --> 00:08:18.170
Something I can help
you with at this hour?

00:08:18.170 --> 00:08:19.890
Well...

00:08:20.310 --> 00:08:24.290
I hear you've been making
really amazing sculptures lately.

00:08:24.290 --> 00:08:26.300
Can I see them?

00:08:27.660 --> 00:08:30.660
I'm not showing them to anyone anymore.

00:08:30.660 --> 00:08:32.740
Tomie belongs to me.

00:08:34.370 --> 00:08:36.500
I'm not just going to go home!

00:08:36.500 --> 00:08:41.260
Have you really been able
to recreate Tomie's beauty?!

00:08:41.260 --> 00:08:43.960
I won't leave until I see it with my own eyes!

00:08:43.960 --> 00:08:45.480
If you don't want to show me,

00:08:45.480 --> 00:08:46.880
I'll force my way in!

00:08:46.880 --> 00:08:48.800
Stop! Don't! Stay out!

00:08:48.800 --> 00:08:50.840
Shut up! Get out of the way!

00:09:01.300 --> 00:09:02.530
Tomie...

00:09:03.440 --> 00:09:05.390
Tomie! Tomie!

00:09:21.120 --> 00:09:22.450
Tomie?

00:09:25.960 --> 00:09:27.750
Mori-sensei!

00:09:27.750 --> 00:09:28.760
Tomie.

00:09:28.760 --> 00:09:29.930
Mori-sensei!

00:09:30.130 --> 00:09:31.910
I was so scared!

00:09:31.910 --> 00:09:35.920
Iwata-sensei smashed
the sculptures himself.

00:09:36.210 --> 00:09:39.680
He managed to make a 
perfect sculpture of me.

00:09:40.070 --> 00:09:43.760
I was so excited, thinking there'd be 
a permanent record of my beauty.

00:09:43.760 --> 00:09:47.560
But then he smashed them all, 
out of the blue!

00:09:48.300 --> 00:09:49.680
Tomie...

00:09:49.680 --> 00:09:52.420
I'm going to make your wish come true.

00:09:52.420 --> 00:09:56.740
This time I'm going to recreate
your beauty on my canvas.

00:09:57.290 --> 00:10:01.240
Really? Sensei, do you mean it?

00:10:01.520 --> 00:10:02.670
Of course!

00:10:02.670 --> 00:10:05.400
Oh, Sensei, I'm so glad to hear that.

00:10:14.080 --> 00:10:15.470
Tomie...

00:10:15.470 --> 00:10:17.200
You're so beautiful.

00:10:17.200 --> 00:10:19.170
How are you so beautiful?

00:10:19.590 --> 00:10:20.960
You know, Sensei...

00:10:20.960 --> 00:10:25.200
it's not the first time that sort
of thing has happened to me.

00:10:25.200 --> 00:10:26.430
What do you mean?

00:10:26.670 --> 00:10:29.940
Almost being killed by a man.

00:10:29.940 --> 00:10:36.200
For some reason, all the men who fall in love
with me want to kill me and tear me apart.

00:10:36.560 --> 00:10:37.860
Strange, isn't it?

00:10:40.140 --> 00:10:41.450
It's finished.

00:10:41.450 --> 00:10:42.780
I've finally done it.

00:10:42.780 --> 00:10:44.490
I've replicated your beauty.

00:10:44.490 --> 00:10:46.590
It's a perfect recreation.

00:10:46.590 --> 00:10:48.110
Take a look!

00:10:48.110 --> 00:10:50.610
This is my greatest work!

00:10:56.370 --> 00:10:58.030
What is that supposed to be?

00:10:58.600 --> 00:11:00.580
Terrible! You're the worst!

00:11:00.580 --> 00:11:02.570
You're the worst painter I've ever seen!

00:11:02.570 --> 00:11:03.880
What?

00:11:03.880 --> 00:11:05.080
Why?

00:11:05.080 --> 00:11:07.090
It's such a beautiful portrait!

00:11:07.090 --> 00:11:08.860
Don't mock me!

00:11:08.860 --> 00:11:10.770
I'm not a monster like that!

00:11:10.770 --> 00:11:13.360
That... That can't be true!

00:11:13.360 --> 00:11:14.840
Take a better look!

00:11:14.840 --> 00:11:16.290
Stop that!

00:11:17.920 --> 00:11:19.520
Why?

00:11:19.520 --> 00:11:21.560
What's wrong with that painting?!

00:11:24.770 --> 00:11:26.190
Tomie?

00:11:26.190 --> 00:11:27.620
What's so funny?

00:11:28.280 --> 00:11:31.370
What's so damn funny?!

00:11:42.470 --> 00:11:43.700
<i>And then...</i>

00:11:57.680 --> 00:11:59.400
<i>And yet,</i>

00:11:59.400 --> 00:12:02.000
<i>Tomie did not die.</i>

00:12:03.700 --> 00:12:08.410
<i>Each dismembered piece of 
her body started to grow anew.</i>

00:12:09.010 --> 00:12:13.710
<i>Their cells reproduced,
creating more and more flesh...</i>

00:12:14.690 --> 00:12:18.320
<i>What a dreadful ability for a woman to have!</i>

00:12:19.220 --> 00:12:20.910
<i>You can be certain that,</i>

00:12:20.910 --> 00:12:26.190
<i>with time, they will all 
grow to look just like her.</i>

00:12:28.900 --> 00:12:31.390
Mori-sensei...

00:12:32.060 --> 00:12:37.060
Collection No. 072

00:12:32.060 --> 00:12:37.060
<b>Painter</b>

00:12:32.070 --> 00:12:33.220
Tomie?

00:12:43.690 --> 00:12:45.270
Nope, it's not budging.

00:12:45.270 --> 00:12:46.940
We're gonna need to call for help.

00:12:46.940 --> 00:12:50.530
How are we going to find help in the 
middle of these remote mountains?

00:12:56.990 --> 00:12:58.640
Hey, are we lost?

00:12:58.640 --> 00:13:00.370
Don't worry.

00:13:00.370 --> 00:13:02.590
But we've been walking for an hour.

00:13:02.590 --> 00:13:05.400
Look, there's a shed over there.

00:13:05.400 --> 00:13:07.810
There must be some kind
of town somewhere nearby.

00:13:12.730 --> 00:13:15.060
See? There's a bunch of kids.

00:13:15.060 --> 00:13:16.690
What are they doing?

00:13:16.690 --> 00:13:19.650
Hey, kids, can I bug you for a sec?

00:13:23.650 --> 00:13:25.560
Where are you from?

00:13:25.560 --> 00:13:27.630
Does anyone have a phone I can use?

00:13:28.580 --> 00:13:30.910
Come on, don't just 
ignore me. Help a guy out.

00:13:31.380 --> 00:13:33.290
We don't have any phones.

00:13:33.290 --> 00:13:35.920
Then where can we find a road?

00:13:45.890 --> 00:13:47.350
Anzai-kun.

00:13:47.350 --> 00:13:49.090
Hey, Anzai-kun!

00:13:49.090 --> 00:13:50.630
Anzai-kun, listen!

00:13:50.630 --> 00:13:51.840
What is it?

00:13:52.590 --> 00:13:53.890
Look behind us.

00:13:56.950 --> 00:13:58.400
What's up, guys?

00:13:58.400 --> 00:14:00.060
Can I help you with something?

00:14:00.060 --> 00:14:01.700
If not, we're moving on.

00:14:08.200 --> 00:14:09.090
Hey!

00:14:09.090 --> 00:14:10.660
What do you think you're doing?

00:14:10.660 --> 00:14:12.450
You okay, Kana?

00:14:16.980 --> 00:14:18.580
Blood...

00:14:18.580 --> 00:14:20.260
Blood!

00:14:20.260 --> 00:14:21.050
No!

00:14:21.050 --> 00:14:26.050
<b>Blood-Bubble Bushes</b>

00:14:21.050 --> 00:14:26.050
Collection No. 058

00:14:26.050 --> 00:14:27.600
You all right, Kana?

00:14:27.600 --> 00:14:28.420
Yeah...

00:14:29.060 --> 00:14:30.500
Can you believe it?

00:14:30.500 --> 00:14:32.710
Those kids sucked my blood!

00:14:32.710 --> 00:14:34.710
They bit me, too.

00:14:34.710 --> 00:14:36.500
A prank gone too far, I guess.

00:14:37.890 --> 00:14:38.730
Hey, look!

00:14:44.410 --> 00:14:46.400
Doesn't look like anyone's living here.

00:14:46.400 --> 00:14:47.950
Is it abandoned?

00:14:48.510 --> 00:14:50.160
Anzai-kun, what is that?

00:14:50.810 --> 00:14:52.000
What are those stains?

00:14:53.510 --> 00:14:56.530
What, you think they're 
blood stains or something?

00:14:56.530 --> 00:14:57.540
Well...

00:15:02.680 --> 00:15:04.310
Something's in there.

00:15:05.600 --> 00:15:07.010
What the hell is that?

00:15:07.780 --> 00:15:08.930
What now?

00:15:08.930 --> 00:15:11.970
Let's see if we can find
anyone living around here.

00:15:19.040 --> 00:15:20.810
Is anyone home?

00:15:20.810 --> 00:15:22.610
Let's just go back now.

00:15:22.610 --> 00:15:23.790
Yeah...

00:15:30.300 --> 00:15:31.360
Can I help you?

00:15:31.790 --> 00:15:33.250
Well...

00:15:33.250 --> 00:15:37.610
our car actually broke down
on the road a ways back.

00:15:37.610 --> 00:15:40.330
Would you mind if we used your phone?

00:15:41.000 --> 00:15:43.730
Unfortunately, I don't have a phone.

00:15:43.730 --> 00:15:45.730
More importantly, miss,

00:15:45.730 --> 00:15:47.020
you seem to be bleeding.

00:15:47.020 --> 00:15:49.940
Some weird kids bit her on our way here.

00:15:49.940 --> 00:15:51.830
Those kids, eh?

00:15:51.830 --> 00:15:54.330
We should do something about that bite.

00:15:54.330 --> 00:15:55.920
Come on inside.

00:16:03.090 --> 00:16:05.160
Are those kids from this village?

00:16:05.160 --> 00:16:06.240
No.

00:16:06.240 --> 00:16:08.940
I'm the only one who lives here.

00:16:09.210 --> 00:16:12.480
I don't know where those kids are from.

00:16:12.480 --> 00:16:14.660
They just come here sometimes.

00:16:15.230 --> 00:16:16.850
How's the pain?

00:16:16.850 --> 00:16:18.610
A lot better.

00:16:19.160 --> 00:16:23.080
Man, we're screwed without a phone...

00:16:23.200 --> 00:16:25.440
The sun's almost set.

00:16:25.440 --> 00:16:27.300
Why don't you stay here tonight?

00:16:29.090 --> 00:16:31.300
You've lived here for a long time?

00:16:31.680 --> 00:16:34.340
I'm sure it seems odd.

00:16:34.340 --> 00:16:37.790
But my state of mind at the time
was what made me feel that way.

00:16:37.790 --> 00:16:39.760
State of mind, huh?

00:16:39.760 --> 00:16:42.180
Your name is Kana-san, right?

00:16:42.180 --> 00:16:46.890
Seeing you reminds me of someone.

00:16:48.220 --> 00:16:50.290
Who's that?

00:16:51.990 --> 00:16:54.740
A woman who was precious to me.

00:16:57.210 --> 00:16:59.720
She was very lonely...

00:17:00.230 --> 00:17:02.520
Everyone avoids me.

00:17:02.520 --> 00:17:03.880
Leaves me.

00:17:04.370 --> 00:17:08.200
You'll want to be rid of me in time, too.

00:17:08.970 --> 00:17:11.390
I tried to let my blood escape.

00:17:11.390 --> 00:17:15.410
I realized that even my blood
didn't want to be near me.

00:17:15.750 --> 00:17:17.480
I figured that out one night.

00:17:19.340 --> 00:17:22.220
Even my blood wants to leave me...

00:17:24.100 --> 00:17:25.550
You can't!

00:17:39.700 --> 00:17:41.530
I knew it.

00:17:43.490 --> 00:17:46.700
It wants to get out of my body.

00:17:48.250 --> 00:17:49.520
Soon,

00:17:50.030 --> 00:17:52.720
I'll be empty...

00:17:57.220 --> 00:17:59.070
But...

00:17:59.070 --> 00:18:02.810
was it really that her blood
wanted to escape her?

00:18:02.810 --> 00:18:05.230
I can't believe that.

00:18:05.230 --> 00:18:08.150
Her blood is a part of her.

00:18:08.250 --> 00:18:12.360
Her blood became a fruit
that will live on forever...

00:18:19.190 --> 00:18:21.750
Man, I'm dizzy.

00:18:22.310 --> 00:18:23.250
Kana?

00:18:30.750 --> 00:18:32.960
<i>Those are blood stains...</i>

00:18:32.960 --> 00:18:34.630
<i>Is it Kana's blood?</i>

00:18:50.270 --> 00:18:53.740
This is what's become
of the woman I loved.

00:18:59.890 --> 00:19:01.920
This warmth...

00:19:01.920 --> 00:19:04.320
She's still alive, you see.

00:19:04.590 --> 00:19:06.550
Where's Kana?!

00:19:06.550 --> 00:19:07.950
What did you do to her?!

00:19:08.650 --> 00:19:10.550
What are you talking about?

00:19:10.550 --> 00:19:13.840
Kana-san should be sleeping in 
the room she shares with you.

00:19:14.300 --> 00:19:16.110
Did you have a dream?

00:19:19.970 --> 00:19:22.320
You seem tired.

00:19:22.320 --> 00:19:24.860
Go and rest, quickly.

00:19:26.780 --> 00:19:29.890
Ru... Run...

00:19:31.540 --> 00:19:32.920
Run for it...

00:19:32.920 --> 00:19:35.820
Quickly... You need to get out!

00:19:35.820 --> 00:19:37.730
Who are you?

00:19:37.730 --> 00:19:39.490
I live here...

00:19:39.490 --> 00:19:40.920
A villager?

00:19:40.920 --> 00:19:43.340
I heard this place is deserted.

00:19:43.340 --> 00:19:45.740
What are you doing here?

00:19:45.740 --> 00:19:47.440
I was planted here...

00:19:47.440 --> 00:19:50.210
By that man!

00:19:52.190 --> 00:19:54.900
He destroyed the village.

00:19:54.900 --> 00:19:57.590
He appeared a few years ago,

00:19:57.590 --> 00:20:05.430
and used some sort of fiendish power to turn 
the villagers into plants that bear bloody fruit.

00:20:05.830 --> 00:20:10.900
What you see right here are the
remains of the other villagers.

00:20:10.900 --> 00:20:15.860
He's created a field to 
farm blood in this room.

00:20:16.320 --> 00:20:18.820
How the hell...

00:20:19.360 --> 00:20:21.330
Get out of here, fast.

00:20:22.370 --> 00:20:25.020
You have to, quickly!

00:20:25.990 --> 00:20:30.830
If you don't, you'll end up as husks, like us.

00:20:34.700 --> 00:20:36.010
Kana...

00:20:37.470 --> 00:20:38.630
Kana!

00:20:39.200 --> 00:20:41.590
Kana, are you okay?

00:20:41.780 --> 00:20:44.200
Come on, let's get out of here.

00:20:44.980 --> 00:20:45.960
Right.

00:20:45.960 --> 00:20:48.560
There's no escape.

00:20:50.520 --> 00:20:53.380
You two will inevitably come back.

00:20:53.380 --> 00:20:55.320
Just look at her neck.

00:20:55.320 --> 00:20:56.720
Beautiful, isn't it?

00:20:57.250 --> 00:21:01.200
She's going to be reborn
as a gem of darkness.

00:21:01.200 --> 00:21:02.810
Shut up!

00:21:02.810 --> 00:21:04.270
Let's go, Kana!

00:21:04.270 --> 00:21:05.830
Can you stand?

00:21:05.830 --> 00:21:06.740
Yeah...

00:21:12.630 --> 00:21:14.240
Anzai-kun, I can't keep going.

00:21:14.240 --> 00:21:16.100
Let's take a break.

00:21:16.100 --> 00:21:17.160
Good idea.

00:21:17.160 --> 00:21:18.710
We've probably come far enough...

00:21:20.320 --> 00:21:22.100
So are we safe now?

00:21:25.790 --> 00:21:27.090
What's wrong?

00:21:27.090 --> 00:21:28.510
Well...

00:21:32.790 --> 00:21:34.980
Isn't there anything we can do about it?

00:21:34.980 --> 00:21:37.220
There is just one way...

00:21:37.220 --> 00:21:41.000
You must eat the fruit that 
grows from your own body.

00:21:41.200 --> 00:21:45.130
But if you eat your own fruit,

00:21:45.130 --> 00:21:49.820
you will develop a bottomless
thirst for the blood of others.

00:23:35.060 --> 00:23:40.180
Collection
